@startuml

cloud "HTTP Clients" as HTTPClients
cloud "Kubescape Security Posture Assessment" as Kubescape
node "Kubernetes Cluster" as K8sCluster {
  node "Privileged DaemonSet: host-scanner" as HostScannerDS {
    package "Interface/API Layer" {
      component "HTTP API" as HTTP_API
      interface "HTTP Endpoints" as HTTPEndpoints
    }

    package "Runtime Resolution Layer" {
      component "CNI Configuration Directory Resolver" as CNIResolver
      component "Runtime/Process Configuration Input Adapter" as ConfigInputAdapter
    }

    package "Sanitization/Data Processing Layer" {
      component "Control-Plane JSON Sanitizer" as JSONSanitizer
      interface "JSON Processing Interface" as JSONProcIface
    }

    artifact "Collected Kubernetes Node Host Information" as NodeHostInfo
  }
}

node "Kubelet" as Kubelet
node "containerd" as Containerd
node "CRI-O" as CRIO
node "Linux Host/Runtime Filesystem" as LinuxFS
cloud "Go Build/Test Environment" as GoBuildEnv

package "Test Support Layer" {
  component "Provider-Specific E2E Test Support" as E2ETestSupport
}

package "Build-Tag Mechanism" {
  component "Go build-tag mechanism" as GoBuildTags
}

HTTPClients --> HTTPEndpoints : HTTP requests
Kubescape --> HTTPEndpoints : consumes host info
HTTP_API -- HTTPEndpoints
HTTPEndpoints --> HTTPClients : 404 for unknown GET /doesnotexist
HTTPEndpoints --> HTTPClients : sanitized host info response

ConfigInputAdapter --> CNIResolver : runtime type, config content, CLI args
CNIResolver --> LinuxFS : reads /etc/cni, /var/lib/cni, config-derived subpaths

JSONSanitizer --> JSONProcIface : sanitized JSON
HTTP_API --> JSONProcIface : consumes sanitized JSON

E2ETestSupport --> HTTPEndpoints : verifies unknown GET /doesnotexist returns 404
E2ETestSupport --> GoBuildTags : provider build tags

HostScannerDS --> Kubelet : collects host/runtime information
HostScannerDS --> Containerd : collects runtime information
HostScannerDS --> CRIO : collects runtime information
HostScannerDS --> LinuxFS : reads host/runtime paths
HostScannerDS --> NodeHostInfo : aggregates collected host information
HTTP_API --> NodeHostInfo : serves collected host information

GoBuildEnv ..> E2ETestSupport : builds/tests
GoBuildEnv ..> GoBuildTags : uses

@enduml
